  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to present your Holy Symbol and exert an intimidating presence. Each creature of your choice that can see or hear you within 30 feet of you must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition until the end of your next turn or until it takes any damage. You can also make any of the Charmed creatures drop what they are holding when they fail the save.</p>",
